B.aGt=new A.yy("ATS based Kerr-Cat Qubit","Participated in the research, design and development of **Asymmetrically Threaded SQUIDs (ATS)**-based Superconducting Kerr Cat Qubits. As a Sub-Team Lead, of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, Q3D, and KQLayout** for quantum circuit development. Under the supervision of **Dr. Shantanu Jha https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=CKj1TYUAAAAJ&hl=en&authuser=3** and **Mr. Muhammad Waqar Amin https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Muhammad-Waqar-Amin**. ",u.E,B.at8,null)
B.aGs=new A.yy("Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium","Participated in the research, design and development of **Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium (FTF)**-based Superconducting Qubits.With implementation of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, KQLayout, and QuTip** for quantum circuit development. My work focused on optimizing circuit parameters to enhance coherence and gate performance, contributing to advancements in superconducting qubit architectures.",u.E,B.ej,null)
